  "worked_solution": "The elements of $B$ are all the terms of the sequence ${b}_{n},$ given by\n\n$$\n{b}_{n}=\\frac{1}{n+6},\\,n\\in {-2,-1,1,2}.\n$$\n\nLet's write down all the terms of our sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{1} & =\\frac{1}{(-2)+6}=\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ {b}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{(-1)+6}=\\frac{1}{5} \\\\ {b}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{1+6}=\\frac{1}{7} \\\\ {b}_{4} & =\\frac{1}{2+6}=\\frac{1}{8}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nB={\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{1}{5},\\frac{1}{7},\\frac{1}{8}}.\n$$",
